§ `Top-level goal`

GIVEN u IS A `Union case`
GIVETH A `Worker position`
`wp` u MEANS `the worker position for` (`Worker case` OF (JUST u), NOTHING, NOTHING)

#ASSERT (`wp` (`dcase` (Date 15 3 2026) NOTHING))'s `last day to complain of the detriment` EQUALS JUST (Date 14 6 2026)
#ASSERT (`wp` (`dcase` (Date 15 3 2026) NOTHING))'s `protected on union grounds` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` (`Worker case` OF NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING))'s `consultation required` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` (`Worker case` OF NOTHING, (JUST (`rcase` 100 100 20 (Date 1 3 2026))), NOTHING))'s `last day for consultation to begin` EQUALS JUST (Date 15 1 2026)
